#: redux-framework/theme-admin-sections/advanced-search-settings.php:276
#: redux-framework/theme-admin-sections/advanced-search-settings.php:312
msgid ""
"*Do not duplicate fields and make sure search fields do not contradict "
"themselves.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t</br>*<strong>Greater, Smaller and Equal</strong> must be used "
"only for numeric fields.\n"
